  "runtime_requirements": [
    "An index whose meta says norm = de-1 is searched only with that rule, and US indexes (no norm key) only with the US rule.",
    "With DE-BE.sqlite installed, every answer from an existing US index stays identical, including its Overture Maps credit.",
    "A bare DE query (77 Linden DE, 77 Linden Delaware) reads DE.sqlite only, never DE-BE.sqlite.",
    "A result names the house the German way (Unter den Linden 77, 10117 Berlin-Mitte) and credits the index meta source.",
    "Only an exact house number is returned: 78 never falls back to 77, nor 12B to 12 or 12A."
  ]
